  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-03-13T16:34:08.745Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This is a feature that is currently locked down under the creator economy, but would drastically help non creator economy developers get recognition easier. I understand all the other features being locked down under the creator economy, but this one should be accessible to everyone.",
